**No native Teams integration** — Northline does not currently offer one [1].

- **Roadmap status**: it's on the public roadmap but not scheduled for release [1].
- **Workaround**: route Teams requests through the embeddable web form or a shared email alias, both of which feed into the unified queue [1].
- **Supported channels today**: Email, web forms, Slack (via `/northline`), and a full REST API/webhooks on Business and Enterprise plans [1].

For current integration details, see https://northline.com/integrations or check [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) for which tiers include API access.